        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(windows): resolve taskkill via full System32 path in core spawns",
        "body": "## Problem\n\nGateway worker processes launched with a truncated `PATH` environment (missing `C:\\Windows\\System32`) cannot find `taskkill.exe`. On Windows, `spawn(\"taskkill\", ...)` emits an `ENOENT` error **asynchronously** — which is not caught by the surrounding `try/catch` — causing the worker process to crash.\n\n### User-facing symptoms (from real incident)\n- `reg` command failures during warmup (slow startup)\n- Gateway repeatedly restarting due to worker crashes  \n- `handshake: failed` because Gateway never finishes initializing\n- Worker crash at `taskkill ENOENT` → Gateway process dies\n\n## Root Cause\n\nFour `spawn(\"taskkill\", ...)` / `spawnSync(\"taskkill\", ...)` calls across `src/process/exec.ts`, `src/cli/update-cli/update-command.ts`, and three scripts use bare command names that rely on `PATH`. When the worker environment is stripped, these all fail.\n\n## Fix\n\n### 1. `src/infra/windows-install-roots.ts` — new helpers\n- `getWindowsSystem32ExePath(executableName)` — resolves executables under `System32` without trusting `PATH`\n- `getWindowsPowerShellExePath()` — same for PowerShell\n\n### 2. `src/process/exec.ts` — 3 sites\n- Replace bare `\"taskkill\"` → `getWindowsSystem32ExePath(\"taskkill.exe\")`  \n- **Add `.on(\"error\", ...)` handlers** so a missing `taskkill.exe` falls back gracefully to `child.kill()` instead of crashing\n\n### 3. `src/cli/update-cli/update-command.ts` — 1 site\n- Replace bare `\"taskkill\"` → `getWindowsSystem32ExePath(\"taskkill.exe\")`\n\n### 4. `scripts/windows-cmd-helpers.mjs` — new helpers\n- `resolveWindowsSystemRoot()`, `resolveWindowsSystem32Path()`, `resolveWindowsCmdExePath()`, `resolveWindowsPowerShellPath()`\n\n### 5. `scripts/lib/windows-taskkill.mjs` — new module\n- `resolveWindowsTaskkillPath()` — script-level entry point for taskkill resolution\n\n### 6. Three scripts fixed\n- `scripts/openclaw-cross-os-release-checks.ts`\n- `scripts/e2e/secret-provider-integrations.mjs`  \n- `scripts/qa-otel-smoke.ts`\n\n## Verification\n\n```\nexec.windows.test.ts          17 passed ✅\nwindows-install-roots.test.ts  9 passed ✅\nexec.test.ts                  12 passed ✅\nrestart-stale-pids.test.ts    53 passed ✅\n```\n\n`reg.exe` already used full path via `getWindowsRegExeCandidates()` — no fix needed.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>",
